WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.534
-Finally, following
President Trump's indictment,

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.834
Trump and many of his allies

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.667
have been claiming
that Manhattan DA Alvin Bragg's

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.300
investigation
is funded by liberal

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.934
mega-donor George Soros.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.501
Here to comment
is one of my writers,

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:12.701
Jeff Wright, everybody.

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:15.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.133
-Thank you.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.400
Thank you, Seth.
Now, first of all,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.734
when I heard all these people
mentioning George Soros,

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:25.634
I had no idea who he was.
I was like, "They're blaming

00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:28.067
Trump's indictment on that dude
that wears glasses

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.767
and lied about
playing volleyball?

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.100
I thought he liked Trump."

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.000
-Oh, Jeff, that's George Santos.
-I know that now.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.934
After looking him up on TikTok.

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:40.334
And it turns out George Soros
is some rich liberal billionaire

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:42.267
who donates
to a lot of Democrats.

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.300
And Republicans think
he's the puppet master

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.534
controlling all the strings on
all these Trump investigations.

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:49.567
And that is offensive.

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:50.968
-Because it's anti-Semitic?

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:53.601
-And racist.
I mean, why can't people admit

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:56.534
that a Black person is capable
of hatching an evil scheme

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:57.868
like this all by himself?

00:00:57.868 --> 00:01:02.601
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:05.467
Seth, look at all these
statements.

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:09.033
Ron DeSantis called Alvin Bragg
Soros-backed.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:12.033
Senator Ron Johnson
called him Soros-funded.

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:15.067
And just look at all these times
Fox News mentioned Soros.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:16.734
-George Soros funded D.A.s.

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:18.400
-George Soros-funded D.A.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.434
-Soros-funded D.A.

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:20.801
-George Soros.
-George Soros.

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:21.667
-George Soros.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:22.501
-Soros.
-Soros.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:24.067
-Soros.
-Soros.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:26.300
-I'm Soros'd out!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.767
Even Trump mentioned Soros
in his speech from Mar-a-Lago.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.801
Why you got to keep
bringing Soros into this?

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:35.234
Let Alvin Bragg enjoy his time
in the spotlight.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:38.868
-Sorry.
So you want Alvin Bragg

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:41.534
to get all the scrutiny
that comes with indicting Trump?

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.834
-Seth, this is
Black people's moment, okay?

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:47.400
Having a Black president
was great,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.501
but letting a Black man
take down Trump,

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:51.267
that's the final boss level.

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:54.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.934
Look, think of it
in Hollywood terms.

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:00.801
It's great when they let
a Black guy star in a movie.

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:02.767
But true equality
can't be achieved

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:05.634
until Black people are allowed
to play the bad guy.

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:08.234
Okay, forget Idris Elba
playing Bond.

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:10.267
Why can't I be a Bond villain?

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:12.968
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:17.000
I see you finally
figured it out, Mr. Bond.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.968
It is I who have been
stealing candy from children.

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:22.100
See, when I was a boy,

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.667
I wasn't allowed
to have candy or friends.

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:29.067
So now neither will the world!

00:02:29.067 --> 00:02:30.334
[ Laughs maniacally ]

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:33.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:37.968
I'm Jeff Wright.

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:39.400
I'm 6' feet tall
and I'm represented

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.334
by Erica Lancaster at CAA.

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:45.534
-Okay, Jeff, so I hear
you calling the investigation

00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:48.033
Soros-funded is racist.
But just to be clear,

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:50.701
it's also anti-Semitic, right?
-Oh, hell yeah, Seth.

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:52.834
They ain't going to catch me on
some Kanye West [bleep].

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:54.868
-Alright.
That's Jeff Wright, everybody.

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:56.467
Give it up for Jeff Wright.
[ Cheers and applause ]

